{"id":"9d1ed3f87b156ecf","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-logical-rule.md","title":"Logical Rule","display":"df-logical-rule — Logical Rule","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-logical-rule","aliases":["92-df-logical-rule"],"display":"df-logical-rule — Logical Rule","depends_on":["[[92-df-inference-rule]]","[[92-df-model]]","[[92-df-assignment]]"],"source":"第 III 章 p. 30（PDF 47）","source_status":"原书规则的本地重构"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-logical-rule"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-logical-rule</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-logical-rule — Logical Rule"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5efcbe99d24a5bd9\" href=\"?note=5efcbe99d24a5bd9\" title=\"92-df-inference-rule\">92-df-inference-rule</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fd60117fc80e6f95\" href=\"?note=fd60117fc80e6f95\" title=\"92-df-model\">92-df-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fdcbc43c728f79fc\" href=\"?note=fdcbc43c728f79fc\" title=\"92-df-assignment\">92-df-assignment</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 III 章 p. 30（PDF 47）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书规则的本地重构"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\langle\\varphi_1,\\ldots,\\varphi_n\\rangle,\\psi)\\in\\mathrm{InfRule}_G\">\\((\\langle\\varphi_1,\\ldots,\\varphi_n\\rangle,\\psi)\\in\\mathrm{InfRule}_G\\)</span> (inference rule, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5efcbe99d24a5bd9\" href=\"?note=5efcbe99d24a5bd9\" title=\"92-df-inference-rule\">92-df-inference-rule</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struc}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Struc}_G\\)</span> (structure class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fd60117fc80e6f95\" href=\"?note=fd60117fc80e6f95\" title=\"92-df-model\">92-df-model</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}_G\\)</span> (assignment constructor, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fdcbc43c728f79fc\" href=\"?note=fdcbc43c728f79fc\" title=\"92-df-assignment\">92-df-assignment</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SoundRule}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{SoundRule}_G\\)</span> (definition-target predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}logical\\text{-}rule} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{SoundRule}_G(\\langle\\varphi_1,\\ldots,\\varphi_n\\rangle,\\psi)\\leftrightarrow\n(\\langle\\varphi_1,\\ldots,\\varphi_n\\rangle,\\psi)\\in\\mathrm{InfRule}_G\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Struc}_G\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bigl[\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\,\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assign}_G(|\\mathfrak M|)\\;(\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G\\varphi_i)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{52mm}\\Longrightarrow\n\\bigl[\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assign}_G(|\\mathfrak M|)\\;(\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G\\psi)\\bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}logical\\text{-}rule} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{SoundRule}_G(\\langle\\varphi_1,\\ldots,\\varphi_n\\rangle,\\psi)\\leftrightarrow\n(\\langle\\varphi_1,\\ldots,\\varphi_n\\rangle,\\psi)\\in\\mathrm{InfRule}_G\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Struc}_G\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bigl[\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\,\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assign}_G(|\\mathfrak M|)\\;(\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G\\varphi_i)\\bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{52mm}\\Longrightarrow\n\\bigl[\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assign}_G(|\\mathfrak M|)\\;(\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G\\psi)\\bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>推理规则：从前提推出结论</li>\n<li>规则形式：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\frac{\\varphi_1, \\ldots, \\varphi_n}{\\psi}\">\\(\\frac{\\varphi_1, \\ldots, \\varphi_n}{\\psi}\\)</span></li>\n<li>例：Modus Ponens：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\frac{\\varphi, \\varphi \\to \\psi}{\\psi}\">\\(\\frac{\\varphi, \\varphi \\to \\psi}{\\psi}\\)</span></li>\n<li>例：Generalization：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\frac{\\varphi}{\\forall x\\, \\varphi}\">\\(\\frac{\\varphi}{\\forall x\\, \\varphi}\\)</span></li>\n<li>这里定义的是 Hilbert 规则所需的“保持有效性”：若每个前提在一个结构的所有赋值下都真，则结论也在所有赋值下真</li>\n<li>不能把 Generalization 错写成保持同一单个赋值下真值的规则；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\models\\forall x\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\models\\forall x\\varphi\\)</span> 对含自由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 的公式并不成立</li>\n<li>规则是证明的&quot;步骤&quot;</li>\n<li>规则的正确性定义</li>\n<li>Hilbert系统的规则集</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>原书确用 MP 与全称概括的有限前提规则，并以有限公式序列定义证明。一般规则的有效性必须另给，不能从“逻辑规则”名字推断。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 III 章 p. 30（PDF 47）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-inference-rule","status":"resolved","id":"5efcbe99d24a5bd9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-inference-rule]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"fd60117fc80e6f95","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"fdcbc43c728f79fc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-inference-rule","status":"resolved","id":"5efcbe99d24a5bd9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(\\langle\\varphi_1,\\ldots,\\varphi_n\\rangle,\\psi)\\in\\mathrm{InfRule}_G$ (inference rule, see [[92-df-inference-rule]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"fd60117fc80e6f95","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struc}_G$ (structure class, see [[92-df-model]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"fdcbc43c728f79fc","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Assign}_G$ (assignment constructor, see [[92-df-assignment]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(\\langle\\varphi_1,\\ldots,\\varphi_n\\rangle,\\psi)\\in\\mathrm{InfRule}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struc}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Assign}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SoundRule}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}logical\\text{-}rule} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{SoundRule}_G(\\langle\\varphi_1,\\ldots,\\varphi_n\\rangle,\\psi)\\leftrightarrow\n(\\langle\\varphi_1,\\ldots,\\varphi_n\\rangle,\\psi)\\in\\mathrm{InfRule}_G\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Struc}_G\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bigl[\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\,\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assign}_G(|\\mathfrak M|)\\;(\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G\\varphi_i)\\bigr]\\\\\n&\\hspace{52mm}\\Longrightarrow\n\\bigl[\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assign}_G(|\\mathfrak M|)\\;(\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G\\psi)\\bigr]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\frac{\\varphi_1, \\ldots, \\varphi_n}{\\psi}","display":false},{"tex":"\\frac{\\varphi, \\varphi \\to \\psi}{\\psi}","display":false},{"tex":"\\frac{\\varphi}{\\forall x\\, \\varphi}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\models\\forall x\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false}],"bytes":2169,"backlinks":[{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-96","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-logical-rule]]"}],"outgoing":["5efcbe99d24a5bd9","fd60117fc80e6f95","fdcbc43c728f79fc"]}